<title>JAPAN: BOJ injects 800 bln yen into money mkt - traders.</title>
<headline>BOJ injects 800 bln yen into money mkt - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan injected a net 800 billion yen into the money market on Monday, money traders said.</p>
</text>
